			"notes": "**Bugfix:** prevented monsters from continuing to target players after zombification\n\n**Bugfix:** made iron golems attack players if they are a zombie\n\n**Bugfix:** players now infect other players if they themselves are infected when they kill someone\n\n**Feat:** prevented the player from picking up new items (if an item type is already present in your inventory it will still stack) unless their mainhand is free\n\n**NOTE:** The Quilt and Forge ports require the Architectury API. Fabric versions require the Fabric API and Cardinal Components API."
